  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to judicial sector reform in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to develop an effective system of community sanctions and measures in Ukraine. The target group is the Ukrainian justice sector, as the Ministry of Justice and Centre of Probation, as well as the prison service, lawyers, courts and prosecution. The project aims to increase the use of community sanctions, update legislation, improve cooperation between the justice chain actors and build capacity of the Ukrainian Probation Service.</narrative>
  </description>
